      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "originalText": "Remote.run()：execute() 后入栈；Remote.undo()：弹出命令并调用 undo()。\nSetPowerCommand.execute() 读取旧值；undo() 恢复 previous，而不是简单取反。\nGo：Command 接口 + Remote.history []Command；每次操作创建新的 *SetPowerCommand。",
      "type": "text",
      "id": "command_note",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 885,
      "width": 1260,
      "height": 85,
      "text": "Remote.run()：execute() 后入栈；Remote.undo()：弹出命令并调用 undo()。\nSetPowerCommand.execute() 读取旧值；undo() 恢复 previous，而不是简单取反。\nGo：Command 接口 + Remote.history []Command；每次操作创建新的 *SetPowerCommand。"
    },
